# Regenerable by-products of grade_thermo_sources.py.
#
# WHAT SHIPS: results/thermo_grades/reaction_grades.tsv -- ONE ROW PER REACTION,
# one grade column. That is the unit the scheme grades: a reaction is graded on
# its collective evidence, so the release must not also carry a per-source
# verdict the scheme does not make. Flipped 2026-09-08; source_grades.tsv (the
# long per-source form) was previously the released table and is now internal.
#
# Regenerate all of them with:
#   python3 Scripts/Thermodynamics/SourceGrading/grade_thermo_sources.py --cv
results/thermo_grades/source_grades.tsv
results/thermo_grades/source_grades_wide.tsv
results/thermo_grades/source_grades_heldout.tsv

